<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 05-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 05-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Andres, with 40 mph winds, is just off the coast of the Mexico/Guatemala Border and is drifting east. It will move inland and weaken this period across northern Guatemala and Belize. Heavy rain and flooding will be the main problem with this system, especially in western areas where mudslides are possible. Wind damage is possible along the immediate coast over the next few hours.</p>
</text>
